{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2013-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1366675200, "end_date": 1367366399, "month_true_total": 823, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:49:55 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "6780550", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074992039", "personaname": "steezus", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/brucenproductions/", "num_games_owned": 742, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 1566, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 164, "last_played": 1726709465, "avatar": "c571f33ca73dcdb5b17ad62eb3b087edd22ac1df"}, "language": "english", "review": "I only played the game for 5 minutes. Every other minute was an update.", "timestamp_created": 1367365431, "timestamp_updated": 1367365431, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51530987024307251", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "535568", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971743486", "personaname": "flaicher", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flaicher/", "num_games_owned": 553, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 176077, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1788138441, "avatar": "cfcd50be2db7db72e3b8e790290ae8a5887b6dde"}, "language": "english", "review": "The best F2P shooter out there.", "timestamp_created": 1367358247, "timestamp_updated": 1367358247, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3896431", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028721846", "personaname": "...", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/18262926/", "num_games_owned": 298, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 902, "last_played": 1453588640, "avatar": "2fb28406c981005cc01877a9218b3afd30d3745d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A cavalcade of co-op-tacular fun! Roam space and kick some grinner butt as you collect and create new suits and weapons with ridiculous abilities, fail at any and all sections that require stealth, pull of crazy tricks with the awesome movemnent/parcour/wallrun mechanics, and shoot lazers that go 'pew pew', oh and it's free!", "timestamp_created": 1367352264, "timestamp_updated": 1367352264, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500520288944244385", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5322675", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047918694", "personaname": "Indiana Mogens", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/IndiMogens/", "num_games_owned": 226, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 56754, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13768, "last_played": 1583934711, "avatar": "d866c11ed5d9c48d9bcaadcafb56273e0382094d"}, "language": "english", "review": "okay the question that humanity has been asking itself over and over again(you aready know what it is off-course) is... wait for it... what happens if you mix 3rd person shooting and space ninjas. well you get WARFRAME. its got over hundred randomly generated space station \"dungeons\" making every game different you have awesome ninja skills like wall running and kicking enemies in the face. and on top of everything, this...game...is...bloddy...free!!. now, to the seriuos review. the game is currently in beta, that means there will be bugs and glitches, i have never found any game breaking bugs though. there currently is 17 classes (warframes) to chose from. this includes healers, tank and mind controllers and all that fun stuff. you will find 3 factions to shoot in the face (sort of 5 but that doesnt matter) the controls feel pretty good to me. overall this game (in my OPINION) is a very, very and yet another very good game", "timestamp_created": 1367347970, "timestamp_updated": 1388823207, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "6449334", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066569811", "personaname": "BloodMisery", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BloodMisery/", "num_games_owned": 103, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3883, "last_played": 1469565373, "avatar": "526a22bc14dd5f827d2fe0b5638972a904595880"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is a good game to begin with. It has a lasting impression and it gets really challenging. The only problem is that it gets boring after a while and to aquire different armor suites it it very difficult. The only other option is to purchess them but I don't usually waste my money on such nonsense. I do recomend Warframe but it is very addicting and I wouldn't recommend it to people who have/had a game addiction.", "timestamp_created": 1367338927, "timestamp_updated": 1367338927, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}